  "description": "Woo-Ju and Yeon-Deok begin living together at the age of twenty. As they navigate Woo-Ju's loneliness together, the two grow closer. However, the closer Woo-Ju draws near, the more nervous Yeon-Deok becomes. One day, as Woo-Ju's obsession with Yeon-Deok intensifies following an incident, Yeon-Deok makes Woo-Ju a proposition. \n\n*\"Put aside all your feelings, whether jealousy or worry... I want you to focus solely on the first half of this year.\"* \n\nA year passes by like that... What will become of this relationship?\n\n(Source: Ridibooks, translated)",
